    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d554">

                <pb facs="0750" n="676" sameAs="frus:frus1866p2/pg676"/>

                <head>Mr. Pruyn to Mr. Seward.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><seg rendition="#float-left">No. 5.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States in
                                Japan,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Kanagawa,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-01-21"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 21, 1865</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> If the gunboat has not sailed, I hope
                    immediate clearance will be granted, as no unsettled difficulties exist between
                    Japan and any treaty power.</p>
                <p>I have honor to be, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>ROBERT H. PRUYN.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington, D. C</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
